open VolumePolynomials MixedVolume MixedVolume.CoefficientCoding MixedVolume.Completeness MixedVolume.AutomatonWords
open MixedVolume.AutomatonMoments MixedVolume.GeneralLocus
namespace PalomarMixedVolume.MainResults
/-- Theorem 1.1, point padding of paper.pdf. -/
